  "title": "Pineapple Pie I",
  "description": "Shredded coconut is sweetened and blended with eggs, a bit of flour, melted butter, and crushed pineapple. creamy sweet filling is then poured into a deep dish pastry shell and popped into the oven to bake for an hour. Cool and serve with freshly whipped cream and toasted coconut.",
